CORE
main.py
--unwind 40 --no-unwinding-assertions --python-smt-containers --smt2
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
model-bound.*FAILURE
--
No model-bound property FIRES for the core ops (append/index/len/
comprehension/slice/sort past the old 16 cap). Discharged scan-bound
obligations (the == scan) may appear as SUCCESS lines; only a FAILURE
is forbidden.
